refer to the product \ndata sheet \n \n2. Schicht 125 µm \n2nd layer 125 µm \n1. Schicht 125 µm \n1st  layer 125 µm \nCS / Cast iron / Cast Ni-resist \nINTERBOND 2340UPC \n \n   250 µm \nINTERBOND 2340UPC",
